### 1. Create a URL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.apple.com",
  "customAlias": "apple-test"
}

### 2. Simulate a Clic
# @no-redirect
GET http://localhost:8080/apple-test

### 3. Check Analytics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls/apple-test/stats

### 1. Test 404 Not Found (Requesting a URL that doesn't exist)
GET http://localhost:8080/this-does-not-exist

### 2. Test 400 Bad Request (Sending an invalid URL format)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "htp://missing-an-s.com",
  "customAlias": "invalid test space!"
}